t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おもり・かり・はか.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">権利</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">权利；特权</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">権</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">权利；权（做某事的权利）；权力；权限；权势</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">棄権</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弃权；放弃权利；退赛</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">支</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>支撑；支持；分支；支付；妨碍</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ささ.える・つか.える・か.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">したく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">准备；筹备；安排</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支給</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">供给；供应；支付；津贴；补助</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支出</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ししゅつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">支出；支付；开支</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">産</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>生产；生育；出生；产物；产地</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.む・う.まれる・うぶ-・む.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">産業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">产业；工业；生计；职业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">生産</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生产；制造</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お土産</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おみやげ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">旅游时买回来送人的当地特产；旅游纪念品；访客带来的伴手礼；来访者带来的礼物；在旅途中意外得到的不愉快之物（如染上的疾病）；令人不快的馈赠；帮了倒忙</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">点</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>点；斑点；标记；小数点；点燃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.ける・つ.く・た.てる・さ.す・とぼ.す・とも.す・ぼち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交差点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうさてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">十字路口；交叉口</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">点；斑点；标记；分数；成绩；评分；分值；得分；进球；得点；（几何学）点；要点；方面；事项；细节；部分；观点；角度；方式；标点符号（如逗号、句号、小数点）；点号；点（汉字笔画）；点、分、球等的计数单位；商品、物品、衣物、艺术作品等的计数单位</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">欠点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けってん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缺点；缺陷；弱点；不足；短处；（考试）不及格；不合格成绩</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">済</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>完成；结清（债务）；救济；减轻（负担）；不必</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ・セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.む・-ず.み・-ずみ・す.まない・す.ます・-す.ます・すく.う・な.す・わたし・わた.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">経済</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经济</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">済む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；结束；完毕；结果比预期轻微；侥幸了事；感到安心；放心；因麻烦别人而感到抱歉；感到内疚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">済ませる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すませる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；结束；做完；凑合；将就；勉强应付；解决；了结；作结</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">活</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>活；复活；活用；生活；生动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.きる・い.かす・い.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">生活</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいかつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生活；生活方式；生计；谋生</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">活気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かっき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">活力；朝气；生气；精力；生机</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">活動</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かつどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">活动；行动；运作；工作；（旧称）电影；影片</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">共</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>共同；一起；全部；同样；与</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とも・とも.に・-ども</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">共通</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">共通的；共有的；共同的；共通；共有；…范围内通用的；…全域的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">共同</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合作；协作；联合；伙伴关系；一致行动；共同体；公共使用；共同拥有；共用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">共に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ともに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一起；共同；同时；与…一起；包括；两者；双方</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">得</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>获得；取得；能够；利益；赚取</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">え.る・う.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">得る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">える</span><span class=\"k-wz\">获得；赚取；取得；获取；获胜；理解；领会；明白；遭受；患上（不良的事物如惩罚、疾病等）；能够；可以</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">得意</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とくい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">满足；自豪；得意；欣喜；专长；特长；擅长的领域；老顾客；常客；主顾</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">納得</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なっとく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">同意；赞成；接受；理解；信服；满意</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">解</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>解开；解决；理解；解释；解除</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ・ゲ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.く・と.かす・と.ける・ほど.く・ほぐ.す・わか.る・さと.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">解決</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいけつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">解决；解决方案；解决方式</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">解釈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいしゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">解释；说明；理解；诠释</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">見解</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">见解</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">交</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>交混；混合；交往；交替；交错</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まじ.わる・まじ.える・ま.じる・まじ.る・ま.ざる・ま.ぜる・-か.う・か.わす・かわ.す・こもごも</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交番</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">派出所；交替；轮换；交替的；交变的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交差点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうさてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">十字路口；交叉口</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交通</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">交通；运输；交流；沟通；往来；交际</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">予</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>预先；事先；我；自己</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨ・シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あらかじ.め</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">予習</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">预习</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">予定</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">预定；安排</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">予約</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">预约；预订；提前订购；合同；订阅；约定；程序设定；设置（如计时器）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">向</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>朝向；面对；趋向；对抗；那边</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">む.く・む.い・-む.き・む.ける・-む.け・む.かう・む.かい・む.こう・む.こう-・むこ・むか.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">向こう</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">对面；另一边；那边；前方；远处；远方；目的地；那里（特指遥远之处，尤指国外）；对方；另一方；今后；此后；接下来的（如「接下来两周」）；从……起</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">向かう</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むかう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">面向；面对；走向；朝向；趋向</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">傾向</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倾向</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">際</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>边缘；界限；时候；场合；交往</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きわ・-ぎわ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">国際</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こくさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">国际的；国际性的；外交往来；邦交往来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">際</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">边缘；边沿；旁边；时；时刻；时候</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交際</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">交际；友谊；交往；社交；相识；（浪漫的）交往；约会；恋爱关系</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>胜利；赢；胜过；优秀</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.つ・-が.ち・まさ.る・すぐ.れる・かつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勝つ</span><span class=\"kana\" l